      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.381,
          "end": 4.49,
          "en": "[Maximilian Schwarzmüller] So, did you succeed?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.49,
          "end": 7.29,
          "en": "Let's build this FlatList together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.29,
          "end": 10.05,
          "en": "For this year, we render a FlatList.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.05,
          "end": 12.9,
          "en": "And you learned that you need to provide the data prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.9,
          "end": 15.68,
          "en": "which points at the array that holds the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.68,
          "end": 17.6,
          "en": "that should be output.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.6,
          "end": 22.6,
          "en": "And in this case, that's our guessRounds state snapshot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.7,
          "end": 25.563,
          "en": "That's the array of data which we wanna output.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.25,
          "end": 29.93,
          "en": "Now then we need to provide render item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.93,
          "end": 32.41,
          "en": "which receives a function that is responsible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.41,
          "end": 35.47,
          "en": "for rendering the individual items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.47,
          "end": 38.32,
          "en": "So a function that will be called by FlatList",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.32,
          "end": 40.883,
          "en": "for every item in our data array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.01,
          "end": 46.09,
          "en": "Now, here we can provide an arrow function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.09,
          "end": 49.37,
          "en": "and we wanna render, let's say a text element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.37,
          "end": 53.71,
          "en": "for every item in this guessRounds array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.71,
          "end": 54.94,
          "en": "And you did learn",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.94,
          "end": 59.54,
          "en": "that you automatically receive the itemData here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.54,
          "end": 60.64,
          "en": "as an argument,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.64,
          "end": 65.64,
          "en": "automatically passed in by React Native, by FlatList.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66.09,
          "end": 68.11,
          "en": "And therefore between those text text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.11,
          "end": 70.08,
          "en": "we can then output itemData.item.value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.5,
          "end": 76.05,
          "en": "if this would be a object with a value property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.05,
          "end": 79.94,
          "en": "but in this case, the item itself is already a number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.94,
          "end": 82.65299999999999,
          "en": "So we just output that item, that number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.52,
          "end": 85.71000000000001,
          "en": "Now, you also learned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.71000000000001,
          "end": 89.4,
          "en": "that the key that uniquely identifies every item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 89.4,
          "end": 92.42,
          "en": "is also needed when working with FlatList.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.42,
          "end": 95.59,
          "en": "But you don't add the key by adding a key prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 95.59,
          "end": 98.69,
          "en": "instead FlatList will add it for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.69,
          "end": 103,
          "en": "It will look for a key property on your data objects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 103,
          "end": 105.71000000000001,
          "en": "But since our data are no objects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 105.71000000000001,
          "end": 108.583,
          "en": "but instead primitive numbers, it won't find that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 109.84,
          "end": 113.03,
          "en": "Hence we can add this keyExtractor prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.03,
          "end": 116.763,
          "en": "where we tell FlatList how to derive a fitting key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 117.83,
          "end": 121.51,
          "en": "And for that here, we provide a function as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 121.51,
          "end": 124.75,
          "en": "which will also be executed by FlatList.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.75,
          "end": 128.82,
          "en": "And in here we get our item, and we know that in this case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 128.82,
          "end": 130.94,
          "en": "the them itself is a perfect key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 130.94,
          "end": 133.18,
          "en": "because the item itself is a number,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 133.18,
          "end": 135.02,
          "en": "which is guaranteed to be unique",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 135.02,
          "end": 137.84,
          "en": "for every guessRounds element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 137.84,
          "end": 139.62,
          "en": "So we have a unique key here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 139.62,
          "end": 144.22,
          "en": "and we just tell FlatList to basically use our data itself",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 144.22,
          "end": 147.333,
          "en": "as a key, since every data item will be unique.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 149.17000000000002,
          "end": 152.84,
          "en": "Okay, so now with that, we have a FlatList,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 152.84,
          "end": 155.85,
          "en": "and if we save this and we give this a try,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 155.85,
          "end": 158.11,
          "en": "this also is looking quite good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 158.11,
          "end": 161.1,
          "en": "And we now render these items here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 161.1,
          "end": 163.07999999999998,
          "en": "As a next step, we of course wanna improve",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 163.07999999999998,
          "end": 164.44,
          "en": "the styling of these items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 164.44,
          "end": 168.053,
          "en": "because at the moment they are, well, ugly, to be honest.",
